    helpCta: 'Still have questions?', helpCtaTxt: 'Rosetta has no live support. You can open an issue in the repository or write to the author.', openIssue: 'Open an issue', writeAuthor: 'Write to the author', seeCode: 'View the code',
    aboutRole: 'Design and development of Rosetta', aboutBio: 'Junior Pentester · eJPTv2 · AI Governance (ISO 42001) · SysAdmin', aboutApp: 'About the tool', aboutContact: 'Contact',
    suiteTitle: 'GRC tools by the author', suiteHere: 'You are here', suiteOpen: 'Open the app', suiteCode: 'Code',
    suiteTxt: 'They work together: ARGOS trains you, Rosetta translates between frameworks, ENS Compliance Studio prepares ENS conformity and KAIROS covers continuity.',
